OL,3,GNEWSAItems being returned to guests
OL,4,Aafter fire, hotel says
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuests at a hotel damaged by fire have
OL,7,Fbegun to have belongings returned, the
OL,8,Fbusiness has said.
OL,10,FAbout 280 guests were forced to leave
OL,11,Fthe Grand Burstin Hotel in Folkestone,
OL,12,FKent, after a blaze took hold at about
OL,13,F01:05 BST on 19 September, while some
OL,14,F90 residents were evacuated from homes
OL,15,Fnearby.
OL,17,FOwner Britannia Hotels Group said it
OL,18,Fhoped to rebuild parts of the building
OL,19,Fand was "continuing to assess the full
OL,20,Fextent of the damage".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
